Sval: Remove the password manager settings

Firefox's password manager is locked off (Sval spec §7.3), so its
settings never show: saving, filling, suggesting strong passwords,
exceptions, OS reauthentication, saved passwords, the Primary Password
and breach alerts. They go from both settings layouts, with their
strings and tests. The Passwords group keeps Windows single sign-on,
and Relay's setting keeps reading the saving setting.

